# SHUTTERBUG: the F in Old Croak's ceiling only comes into view as his
# fight starts, and the camera can't take both the F and him: a photo
# refills in 22 s and he gives up after 20 s. The demo player, out for the
# letters, photographs the F and can't finish him; told to leave the
# letters alone, it photographs him instead and beats him.
game shutterbug
cheat run 1
cheat stage 3
cheat lives 9
cheat goto 2400
botuntil cam_x >= 2590 600
expect letters == 0
expect fx_26 > 316
botuntil hold == 1 200
botuntil foes_31 == 0 2000
expect letters == 2
expect big_kills == 0
expect photos == 1
# the other choice
cheat letterbot 0
cheat run 1
cheat stage 3
cheat lives 9
cheat goto 2400
botuntil hold == 1 600
botuntil foes_31 == 0 2000
expect letters == 0
expect big_kills == 1
